  "historyNote": "#4970, eff 11-8-90, EXPIRED: 11-8-96 New. #6517, eff 5-30-97; amd by #7949, eff 9-6-03; amd by #8096, eff 6-5-04; amd by #8429, eff 9-13-05; amd by #8662, INTERIM, eff 6-16-06, EXPIRED: 12-13-06 (paragraphs (a), (b)(2)-(6), (14) and (15), now (15) and (17), and (c)); ss by #8945, eff 7-18-07; ss by #9900, eff 4-12-11 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Med 400); amd by #10876, eff 7-8-15; amd by #11048, eff 3-2-16; ss by #12972, eff 1-10-20",
